# Run 374: operator identity-generation output (DevNet-only, never commit secret
# or generated identity material). These are safety-net patterns; operators
# should generate into a temp dir OUTSIDE the repo tree (see
# docs/release/public-devnet/identity/SAFETY.md). Run 375 adds the first-class
# `qbind-node identity` command, which writes the same material.
qbind-identity-out/
*.kem.sk.bin
*.kem.pk.bin
*.cert.bin
root.pk.hex
root.id.hex
trusted-root.spec
public-identity.json